int card_felidar_umbra(int player, int card, event_t event){
/* CARD_ID_FELIDAR_UMBRA	12523
Felidar Umbra	|1|W
Enchantment - Aura
Enchant creature
Enchanted creature has lifelink.
|1|W: Attach ~ to target creature you control.
